 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Good she' here. A small bowl of warm chicken noodle soup is a classic. A few spoonfuls of plain rice crackers are great side. Then stick with yellow food. The soup is a good start, and easy things like soft toast and scrambled eggs. A small bowl of porridge with milk is fine. Or a toasted bagel with a little sardine on top. Let her stir the soup and chop the crackers. Ask her to read the recipe with you.",
